{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:15 2026-11-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:15 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:15 2026-11-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"fb「黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......)」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31bb914cf5a562eb29842a6386870502/2026-11/FotoJet_10.jpg\"/><p>今日（15日）早上8時47分，黃大仙下邨龍光樓一單位發生火警，多名居民報案，並指有爆炸聲傳出。消防員接報到場，出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，初步沒有人受傷，約50人疏散。火警原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"fb「黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......)」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3286d2356090ba627930f942d3d1ae0/2026-11/6_1_32.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T01:33:21.478768+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T01:15:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T01:26:47.478081+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T01:26:47.478081+00:00","content_hash":"bc06a5bbf7e6c71c4d60019ea4cfcd51b9be54ce4fa7a8520cef9081e8069467","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}